{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOOD RUSH</strong> is an intense roguelite FPS in development inspired by genre titans such as <i>ULTRAKILL</i> and <i>Hades</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a procedurally generated Hell, seize unique weapons, unlock new abilities, and create powerful synergies to overcome the challenges standing between you and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.poster.avif?t=1769283978\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.webm?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0eda21a14779487406bf17a33dfd081e.mp4?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is unforgiving, your movement skills will be your greatest asset against the relentless hordes of enemies. Whether you choose to dodge attacks from a safe distance or adopt a more aggressive approach, a well-placed headshot will always make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.poster.avif?t=1769283978\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.webm?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.mp4?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idols and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of Hell and harness the power of <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Idols</strong>, granting you powerful upgrades and unique abilities. Adapt your playstyle on the go based on the synergies you discover and the opportunities you seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.poster.avif?t=1769283978\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.webm?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.mp4?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a state of <i>flow</i> during combat to restore your health and gain various bonuses. This state is achieved by actively engaging with the game\u2019s combat mechanics and playing dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die... and Try Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will inevitably fall\u2026 but this is not the end, <strong>you are already dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persevere, learn from each failure, and push ever forward in your quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defeat Argos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/edafa21558ce28618dac95c8a454d6abfa5d4a90.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the censer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/0e1021d5fc5b65efb835e9fa301fbaf70a53cf46.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Antichrist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/27a5105aa18278e177551c3d5954f7935f5d04b9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Cain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/94b2a2783f5550a6e9d200de53e20005e89b7857.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Mammon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/7a79105daf8f9c6882a442fb4e8d789dd8e4c790.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Pandora's box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/6d4f21d55ec6553c07c6e6f41b61183e18b5ea85.jpg"},{"name":"Infused weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/8611fcf6c78b21d7c117b1bb1039a41e82481012.jpg"},{"name":"Self hatred","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/6fd261e9b44923670f23cafe27f514754555ab1f.jpg"},{"name":"Parry pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/146ae27c5d6563f6ca1e902f9f927c5604db7809.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks for your support","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/6838d5c683b489279240c0c1c213e6605e352311.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2435870?t=1769283978","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/dec42b108e4bf65a56c18237169f885c5bdcb9a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769283978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/858e21f778e203d59dbee76206df146a2a29ad0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769283978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea