rong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is unforgiving, your movement skills will be your greatest asset against the relentless hordes of enemies. Whether you choose to dodge attacks from a safe distance or adopt a more aggressive approach, a well-placed headshot will always make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.poster.avif?t=1769283978\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.webm?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/f60049723ee1a2f7bf14287819c46e5c.mp4?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idols and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of Hell and harness the power of <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Idols</strong>, granting you powerful upgrades and unique abilities. Adapt your playstyle on the go based on the synergies you discover and the opportunities you seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.poster.avif?t=1769283978\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.webm?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/0451998a0878cd107b62410751bba89e.mp4?t=1769283978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a state of <i>flow</i> during combat to restore your health and gain various bonuses. This state is achieved by actively engaging with the game\u2019s combat mechanics and playing dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die... and Try Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will inevitably fall\u2026 but this is not the end, <strong>you are already dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persevere, learn from each failure, and push ever forward in your quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["MaxEstLa"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/83d45268d984ee06fc22fce2a2b863242187f516/header.jpg?t=1769283978","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2435870/1379194536/e30c1b4062b540f785772a31d2284540a14dec91/1769282470/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769283975","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2435870/1379194536/e30c1b4062b540f785772a31d2284540a14dec91/1769282470/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769283975","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2435870/1379194536/e30c1b4062b540f785772a31d2284540a14dec91/1769282470/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769283975","id":257272164,"name":"Blood Rush - Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257272164/f6ca8f565527e760cedadb608428d66eec147d0f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769283975"}],"name":"Blood Rush","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text